===Powerful Synergies===
Some targets deal ludicrous amounts of damage with forced procs and damage buffs from Buffing Fields, namely:
*{{Weapon|Morgha}}'s [[Morgha#Characteristics|alt-fire]]
*{{WF|Garuda}}'s {{A|Dread Mirror}} projectile and AoE

==Bugs==
*Abilities that would normally benefit (e.g. {{A|Shuriken}}, {{M|Neutron Star}}) do '''not''' benefit from {{M|Conductive Sphere}} if they are infused onto the same {{WF|Gyre}} that cast it.
*{{Weapon|Tenet Grigori}}'s [[Tenet Grigori#Characteristics|energy disk]] and {{Weapon|Fluctus}} projectiles get stuck in place if activated inside multiple {{M|Conductive Sphere}}'s.
*The following attacks' projectiles/targeting/damage is blocked from any direction by {{M|Conductive Sphere}}:
**{{WF|Baruuk}}'s {{A|Desolate Hands}} ability
**{{WF|Nova}}'s {{A|Null Star}} ability
**{{WF|Vauban}}'s {{A|Minelayer|Tether Coil}} ability
**{{WF|Nokko}}'s {{A|Stinkbrain}} ability
**{{WF|Vauban}}'s {{A|Bastille}} ability vortex
**{{Weapon|Scyotid}}'s alt-fire
**{{WF|Wisp}}'s {{M|Cataclysmic Gate}} augment
**[[Hound (Companion)|Hound's]] {{M|Focused Prospectus}} precept
**{{Companion|Carrier}}'s {{M|Looter}} precept
**[[Explosive Barrel]]
**[[Arc Trap]]
*{{WF|Mesa}}'s {{Weapon|Regulators}} cannot benefit from {{M|Conductive Sphere}} despite it usually buffing other non-melee [[Exalted Weapon]]s. ''(may be intended)''
*{{WF|Excalibur}}'s {{A|Radial Javelin}} spectral skana will spin wildly around the enemy if it spawns inside a {{M|Conductive Sphere}}, living until eventually hitting the enemy.
**It looks similar to {{Weapon|Nataruk}} projectiles shot into {{WF|Mag}}'s {{A|Magnetize}} bubble.
*{{Weapon|Simulor}}'s primary fire/[[Simulor#Notes|singularity]] stops all projectiles like a wall.
*{{Weapon|Mandonel}}'s fully [[Mandonel#Notes|charged fire]] doesn't give [[Bounce]] and/or [[Punch Through]] to [[Abilities]], [[Gear]], and [[Amps]]. ''(maybe those stats are simply locked)''
*Some projectiles bounce off {{Weapon|Mutalist Quanta}}'s [[Mutalist Quanta#Alternate Fire Mechanics|alt-fire]], some stick to it, some are blocked, and some (very high punchtrough) can go through.

